  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\mathrm{A}=\\{(x, y) \\in \\mathbf{R} \\times \\mathbf{R}:|x+y| \\geqslant 3\\}$ and $\\mathrm{B}=\\{(x, y) \\in \\mathbf{R} \\times \\mathbf{R}:|x|+|y| \\leq 3\\}$.\nIf $\\mathrm{C}=\\{(x, y) \\in \\mathrm{A} \\cap \\mathrm{B}: x=0$ or $y=0\\}$, then $\\sum_{(x, y) \\in \\mathrm{C}}|x+y|$ is :",
