  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & A=\\{(x, y) \\in \\mathbf{R} \\times \\mathbf{R}:|x+y| \\geq 3\\} \\\\ & \\text { and } B=\\{(x, y) \\in \\mathbf{R} \\times \\mathbf{R}:|x|+|y| \\leq 3\\} \\\\ & C=\\{(x, y) \\in A \\cap B: x=0 \\text { or } y=0\\}\\end{aligned}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/tu2o4lxXTKS59YcsJ5lTvblslwcCAI7-f6sG5zUNTpo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$A \\cap B$ will have only common points lying on the line $P Q$ and $R S$\nNow, $C=\\{(-3,0),(3,0),(0,3),(0,-3)\\}$\n$\\sum_{(x, y) \\in c}|x+y|=3+3+3+3=12$",
    "image": null
